# The 14th letter of the [[Serbo-Croatian Cyrillic alphabet]].

====Usage notes====
Its name is '''љ''' (lj) and it has no equivalent in English.
It is pronounced by combining the sounds ''l'' and ''y''. It is similar to the Spanish ''ll''.

